:v_cond: Post-Delivery Condition ({5 Days Passed, Loss Claim Lodged}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v_cond = '5 Days Passed'] 5 days have passed)
:Invoice the Customer;
stop
else ([v_cond = 'Loss Claim Lodged'] Loss Claim Lodged)
:Approve Loss Claim and End Process;
stop
endif
